    },
    {
      "id": "4NuEw",
      "text": "$2 \\mathrm{ms}^{-2}$",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given, $m=2 \\mathrm{kg}, \\mu=0.2$ and $g=10 \\mathrm{ms}^{-2}$\r\nHere, $\\quad m a=\\mu m g$\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}{l}\r\na=\\mu g \\\\\r\na=0.2 \\times 10 \\\\\r\na=2 \\mathrm{m} / \\mathrm{s}^{2}\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$",
